From 37cd1ff2f6b904d706920383612899869b1c396d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:18:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/54] hw/display/pvg/pvg-exec: multiple render targets,
 per-pass pipeline variants, diagnostics

Render passes now bind all colour attachments; pipelines are specialised
per pass attachment formats with per-index blend state (attachment index
defaults to list position). Fixes SetVertex/FragmentBufferOffset field
order ({u32 index, u64 offset}) which produced out-of-range device
addresses, adds buffer/index bounds checks, an arena guard zone, a
dry-run mode, and diagnostic logging/dumps of kernel-backing writebacks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
